# `data/` is the staging area: stage_batch.py copies one batch in at a time, and
# it is the directory the project's `locations` point at. Its contents are a copy
# of whichever batch is staged, so committing them would only duplicate
# `batches/`.
#
# The directory itself is kept (via .gitkeep) because `depictio ingest` validates
# the configured location as an existing directory before scanning.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
